-----------------------------------------------------------------
                         PsiCam V0.9b
-----------------------------------------------------------------

This application is able to communicate with Olympus Camedia 420L
camera over serial line, take pictures, erase pictures and
download pictures from camera to Psion computer.

-----------------------------------------------------------------
                  This small program is freeware.
-----------------------------------------------------------------

How to install:

1. Create new folder called "PsiCam" in your "C:\System\App" or "D:\System\App" directory.
2. Copy files "PsiCam.app" and "PsiCam.aif" into this folder.

What do you need to connect Camedia to Psion:

You will have to connect PsiWin cable to camera serial cable.
You can use:

1. Nullmodem with DB9 connectors

                OR

2. Homemade reduction, just connect pins:

         PsiWin cable        Camera cable
         DB9 conector        DB9 conector
              3        TX/RX       2
              2        RX/TX       3
              5         GND        5

